<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photogzerii" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4941754); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4941754&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606723304" alt="photogZerii" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4941754)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photogzerii" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4941754); return false;">photogZerii</a></span>：</strong>不是swun-001，是<a href="/operation-overmeta">swn001-1</a>。</p>
